Today is Saturday.
It is evening time now.
I am in my home.
Tonight I am cooking a special dinner.
I am cooking Mexican food with Indian spices.
Yesterday I bought new Indian spices from the shopkeeper.
First, I cut tomatoes and onions.
Then I place a pot on the stove.
I add a little oil and cumin there.
Then I add the tomatoes and Mexican beans there.
My mother's recipe now mixes with the Indian taste.
Its smell is very good.
A familiar smell spreads in the entire kitchen.
This smell is very comforting.
I remember my home in Mexico.
But here in Mumbai too, I am happy.
I taste the food.
It is very tasty!
After some time, Asha will come here for dinner.
She will definitely like this new food.
